{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1069", "sample_idx": 44, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "Subject: Invitation to Meeting on Upcoming Project\n\nDear Team Members\n\nI am writing to formally invite you to a meeting that will be held on Friday at 2 PM in the main conference room. The purpose of this meeting is to discuss the upcoming project that we will be undertaking and to outline the key objectives and milestones that we need to achieve.\n\nAs you are aware our company has been experiencing significant growth over the past quarter and this new project is a key part of our strategy to continue this trend. The project involves the development of a new product that is correlated with our existing product line and is expected to appeal to our target market.\n\nThe meeting will provide an opportunity for us to discuss the project in detail and to outline the roles and responsibilities of each team member. We will also be discussing the timeline for the project and the key milestones that we need to achieve in order to meet our deadlines.\n\nI expect all team members to come prepared to the meeting with their ideas and suggestions on how we can successfully deliver this project. We will be discussing the project requirements and the resources that we will need to allocate in order to meet our objectives.\n\nThe project is a high priority for our company and I expect everyone to be fully engaged and committed to its success. We will be working closely with our stakeholders to ensure that we meet their expectations and deliver a high-quality product.\n\nDuring the meeting we will be covering a number of key topics including the project scope and objectives the timeline and milestones the roles and responsibilities of team members and the resources that we will need to allocate.\n\nI have attached a draft agenda to this email for your review. The agenda outlines the key topics that we will be discussing during the meeting and provides a clear outline of what we hope to achieve.\n\nThe meeting will be an important step in the project's development and will provide a clear direction for the team. I am confident that with our collective expertise and experience we will be able to deliver a successful outcome.\n\nIf you are unable to attend the meeting please let me know as soon as possible so that we can make alternative arrangements. I look forward to seeing you all on Friday at 2 PM.\n\nIn preparation for the meeting I encourage you to review the project documentation that has been shared with you and to come prepared with your questions and comments.\n\nThe success of this project is critical to our company's continued growth and I am excited to be working with all of you to achieve our objectives. We are experiencing a period of significant change and this project is a key part of our strategy to drive future growth.\n\nI am confident that our team has the skills and expertise to deliver a high-quality product that meets the needs of our customers. The project is correlated with our existing product line and will provide a valuable addition to our portfolio.\n\nI look forward to discussing the project in more detail on Friday. Please do not hesitate to contact me if you have any questions or concerns prior to the meeting.\n\nThank you for your participation and commitment to the project's success.\n\nBest regards\n[Your Name]", "logprobs": [{"token": "Subject", "logprob": -0.12692931294441223}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0026806395035237074}, {"token": " Inv", "logprob": -0.011139464564621449}, {"token": "itation", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Meeting", "logprob": -0.04993727430701256}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -0.3152921497821808}, {"token": " Upcoming", "logprob": -2.214418888092041}, {"token": " Project", "logprob": -0.0015073377871885896}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.12879560887813568}, {"token": "Dear", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Team", "logpro